IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting (Class Licence) (Amendment) Notification 2013 (S 330/2013), made under ss 9 and 11 of the Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-class-licence-amendment-notification-2013/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S330-2013.txt (e-Gazette PDF, pdftotext -layout, unedited). Quotations below are lines of THAT file; `srcrefs.py` is run on this module against it.
-- First published 29 May 2013 at 5.00 pm; "shall come into operation on 1st June 2013" (paragraph 1).
-- It amends paragraph 3 of N 1 and inserts paragraph 3A (exclusion from the class licence by notice). The lawplain text of N 1 shows paragraph 3A with this amendment note.

§ `Paragraphs 2 and 3`

-- src:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 29th May 2013 at 5.00 pm.
-- src:21 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Broadcasting (Class
-- src:22 | Licence) (Amendment) Notification 2013 and shall come into
-- src:23 | operation on 1st June 2013.
@ref S 330/2013 publication line and para 1 (commencement) (src:3-23)
GIVEN `the day of the conduct` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 330/2013 the amendments are in operation on` MEANS
    `the day of the conduct` AT LEAST (Date 1 6 2013)

-- src:26 | 2. Paragraph 3 of the Broadcasting (Class Licence) Notification
-- src:27 | (N 1) is amended by inserting, immediately after the words “a class
-- src:28 | licence”, the words “, except a computer on-line service provided on
-- src:29 | or after such date as the Authority specifies in a notice given to the
-- src:30 | provider of the service under paragraph 3A”.
@ref S 330/2013 para 2: N 1 para 3 amended (a computer on-line service provided on or after the date the Authority specifies in a notice under paragraph 3A is not covered by the class licence) (src:26-30)
GIVEN `the service is provided on or after the date the Authority specified in a notice under paragraph 3A` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 330/2013 N 1 para 3 the computer on-line service is excepted from the class licence` MEANS
    `the service is provided on or after the date the Authority specified in a notice under paragraph 3A`

-- src:35 | “Exclusion from class licence
-- src:36 | 3A.––(1) A notice may be given by the Authority to any
-- src:37 | person who provides a computer on-line service in or from
-- src:38 | Singapore, whether for payment or free, and whether at regular
-- src:39 | intervals or otherwise ––
-- src:40 | (a) that is accessed from at least 50,000 different Internet
-- src:41 | protocol addresses in Singapore per month on average,
-- src:42 | over any period of 2 consecutive months; and
-- src:43 | S 330/2013 2
-- src:45 | (b) that contains at least one Singapore news programme
-- src:46 | per week on average, over the same period of 2
-- src:47 | consecutive months referred to in sub-paragraph (a),
-- src:48 | and that notice shall not cease to have effect by reason only that
-- src:49 | the computer on-line service concerned ceases subsequently
-- src:50 | to satisfy sub-paragraph (a) or (b) during the validity of any
-- src:51 | broadcasting licence under section 8 of the Act relating to that
-- src:52 | service.
@ref S 330/2013 para 3: N 1 para 3A(1) (a notice to a provider of a service with at least 50,000 IP addresses a month and a Singapore news programme a week) (src:35-52)
GIVEN `the average number of different Internet protocol addresses in Singapore per month over 2 consecutive months` IS A NUMBER
      `the average number of Singapore news programmes per week over the same 2 consecutive months` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 330/2013 N 1 para 3A(1) the Authority may give a notice` MEANS
    `the average number of different Internet protocol addresses in Singapore per month over 2 consecutive months` AT LEAST 50000 AND `the average number of Singapore news programmes per week over the same 2 consecutive months` AT LEAST 1

-- src:53 | (2) For the purposes of reckoning access and content under
-- src:54 | sub-paragraph (1)(a) and (b) ––
-- src:55 | (a) where a computer on-line service is provided by a web
-- src:56 | site with a domain and one or more sub-domains, all
-- src:57 | sub-domains shall be regarded as part of the domain
-- src:58 | of the web site; and
-- src:59 | (b) where a computer on-line service is provided by a
-- src:60 | web site in or from Singapore (referred to in this
-- src:61 | sub-paragraph as the original web site) which is
-- src:62 | duplicated on or transferred to one or more other
-- src:63 | web sites in or from Singapore (referred to in this
-- src:64 | sub-paragraph as the mirrored web site), all mirrored
-- src:65 | web sites shall be regarded as part of the original web
-- src:66 | site.
@ref S 330/2013 para 3: N 1 para 3A(2) (sub-domains and mirrored web sites are counted as one) (src:53-66)
-- A reckoning rule for the counts the two inputs above ask for; it is not a function of its own.

-- src:67 | (3) In this paragraph, “Singapore news programme”
-- src:68 | means any programme (whether or not the programme is
-- src:69 | presenter-based and whether or not the programme is provided
-- src:70 | by a third party) containing any news, intelligence, report of
-- src:71 | occurrence, or any matter of public interest, about any social,
-- src:72 | economic, political, cultural, artistic, sporting, scientific or any
-- src:73 | other aspect of Singapore in any language (whether paid or
-- src:74 | free and whether at regular intervals or otherwise) but does
-- src:75 | not include any programme produced by or on behalf of the
-- src:76 | Government.”.
@ref S 330/2013 para 3: N 1 para 3A(3) ("Singapore news programme") (src:67-76)
GIVEN `the programme contains news, intelligence, a report of occurrence or any matter of public interest about any aspect of Singapore, in any language` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the programme was produced by or on behalf of the Government` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 330/2013 N 1 para 3A(3) the programme is a Singapore news programme` MEANS
    `the programme contains news, intelligence, a report of occurrence or any matter of public interest about any aspect of Singapore, in any language` AND (NOT `the programme was produced by or on behalf of the Government`)
